      "id": "variant:yosoi::ResponseTermination::Completed",
      "publicPath": "yosoi::ResponseTermination::Completed",
      "title": "yosoi::ResponseTermination::Completed",
      "kind": "variant",
      "signature": "Completed",
      "docs": "Execution finished without observing caller cancellation.\n\nThis does not imply that every acquisition attempt succeeded. Inspect\n[`Response::attempts`] for typed failures and partial outcomes. An empty\nacquisition sequence also completes. Cancellation arriving after the last\nobservation does not retroactively change this result.",
